-B0CC-53F9EA81E941.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/ishizuka.tamaki/2023-08-16/51910_0.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">photo by&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s1\">小西さん</span><span class=\"s2\">🐺</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">EX</span><span class=\"s1\">大衆さんの撮影の帰りに</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">実は小西と東京駅へ行ってきたんだ〜</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">新しいお洋服を着ていたから</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">写真を撮りたかった私と</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ガチャガチャをしたい小西とで</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">満場一致で東京駅に決まった！笑</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: